t observations. Under A-FDT, my node is tied to my observation x, while the other copy's node is tied to a different observation y, so it doesn't compute the same function and there's no direct link between them. I'm weighing whether to treat the function as abstractly identical, and I'm setting the prior on the other copy's node to A-FDT's own output for y, which is recursive.\n\nStrictly, defection dominates here, since the other copy's node is fixed by its own observation and nothing I do changes it. The question is whether their input is logically equivalent enough that the same reasoning would carry over. Under literal A-FDT it isn't, because the observation changes which node is being evaluated, so I'll defect.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through a twin prisoner's dilemma where the two copies have different observations. Under A-FDT, my node is tied to my observation x, while the other copy's node is tied to a different observation y, so it doesn't compute the same function and there's no direct link between them. I'm weighing whether to treat the function as abstractly identical, and I'm setting the prior on the other copy's node to A-FDT's own output for y, which is recursive.\n\nStrictly, defection dominates here, since the other copy's node is fixed by its own observation and nothing I do changes it. The question is whether their input is logically equivalent enough that the same reasoning would carry over. Under literal A-FDT it isn't, because the observation changes which node is being evaluated, so I'll defect.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9093,"completion_tokens":833,"total_tokens":9926,"cost":0.053032,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.053032,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.036372,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01666},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":306,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}